  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="entry">
        <sp who="#wc">
          <speaker>Clark</speaker>
          <p>Line the boats for a clean landing before the sandbar catches us.</p>
        </sp>
        <sp who="#ml">
          <speaker>Lewis</speaker>
          <p>I have set the instruments again before dawn. Several species observed near camp.</p>
        </sp>
